4-10-01T21:54:55-07:00","id":270587,"title":"","content":"Define Dragon, we use it for all sorts of things and thus its used for all sorts of things in the world of darkness. You have the Mokole(and particularly their asian variants) who will give you all sorts of options on the transform into something big and reptilian. You have a variety of spirits from many or Uktena's brood(Uktena, Seiryuu, etc) to the Green dragon. You have the Zmei that are great wyrm beasts. That's just in werewolf.<br /> <br /> Now in Mage one has all sorts of bygones(creatures that used to live on earth but cannot any long because.. reasons) this includes various types of dragons.<br /> <br /> Next we have Changeling, changeling has them as a broad part of Chimera(stuff of pure dream) but also had them as something seperate in Arcadia during the illfated card game.<br /> <br /> In wraith we have The national dragons in the Jade empire creations of rebelion that look like dragons that are a bunch of people moliated into one super killing machine. Also Lord of the kingdom of Jade is probably a Neverborn who's &quot;natural&quot; shape is a chinese Dragon.<br /> <br /> Demon, nothing specific but there's a strong mythic connection between dragons and demons so having one with a Draconic Apocalyptic form would seem fairly reasonable to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T22:31:03-07:00","id":270616,"title":"","content":"Actually, I seem to remember that dragons, as well as hawk spirits, live in the Atherial Realm. I think this was mentioned in Book of Worlds. Honestly, I want some more info on bygone dragons as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T03:31:14-07:00","id":270681,"title":"","content":"Well, my player wishes to know all about all the different kinds and races and what happend to them. she was lead to belive that all dragons were exterminated durint the Mage Crussade so she wanted to know what happend to all of this beings and its subspecies. (by dragon, giant freaking lizard with wings)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T04:52:05-07:00","id":270729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/270533-dragons-what-happend?p=270681#post270681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, my player wishes to know all about all the different kinds and races and what happend to them. she was lead to belive that all dragons were exterminated durint the Mage Crussade so she wanted to know what happend to all of this beings and its subspecies. (by dragon, giant freaking lizard with wings)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Mage: Certain animals are more &quot;Paradigmatic&quot; than others, dragons, unicorns, Gryphons and sasquatch can't exist but Platypus, Gorrillas, Okampi and Narwhales do.. for reasons that don't quite make sense internally but have to match up to real world so that's how it works.<br /> <br /> Werewolf: Dragons have always been spirit thingies alot of them are Wyrm servants(Get it hurr hurr Dragons Wyrm) you also get Mokole who are as much weredragons as anything else.<br /> <br /> Changeling: Dragons exist in the Dreaming because its the Dreaming.<br /> <br /> Other games: Various powers can be used to be Dragons, these thing are just as much dragons as anything else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T06:22:49-07:00","id":270765,"title":"","content":"I found the Zmei pretty awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/